'''Wrestling Cat''' (サホリ ''Sahori'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Maiden Awakes!]] She was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Wrestling Cat
|appearance = [[Maiden Awakes!]]
|image = E 234.png
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy possesses huge health, high damage, and a quick attack rate. Her falling point is her Single Target attack, which makes her very easy if you can meatshield well.

