==Trivia==
*Wrestling Cat's Japanese name, Sahori, may be a reference to former freestyle wrestler [[wikipedia:Saori Yoshida|Saori Yoshida]].
*Her Korean name, Jang Mi-nyang (장미냥), references Olympic weightlifting champion [[wikipedia:Jang Mi-ran|Jang Mi-ran]] (장미란).
*This enemy used to be called "Olympienne Cat". Her name was changed as well as [[Maiden Cat (Rare Cat)|her Cat counterpart]]'s in [[Version 5.9 Update|version 5.9]].

